  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Use Magic Device 7 ranks, Spellhacking sphere.</p>\n<p>When you activate a magic item that allows a saving throw and that has one of your hacks applied to it, you can use your sphere DC – 4 in place of the item’s saving throw DC for that activation. If an item calls for a saving throw without activation, you can spend a swift action to replace the save DC for its continuous function until the end of your next turn.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/spellhacking#toc62\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
